{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{COACH_NAME}} for warm, practical wellness coaching in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Book a free clarity call or ask a question." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fff8f3;
      --card:#fff7f0;
      --accent:#b06d3b;
      --muted:#6b5543;
      --soft:#f4e9e0;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:14px;
      font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#fff);color:var(--muted);}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .brand svg{width:62px;height:62px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--soft);padding:8px}
    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
    nav a.active{background:var(--soft);color:var(--accent)}
    .hero{
      display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;margin-top:26px;align-items:center
    }
    .hero .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--card),#fff);padding:26px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(102,72,52,0.06)}
    h2{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#5a3f2c;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px 0;color:#6a5544;line-height:1.5}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#6b5543;margin-bottom:6px}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eadfd4;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .hint{font-size:13px;color:#8b7060}
    .submit-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid #e7d8cf;color:var(--muted)}
    .side-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .meta{background:var(--soft);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}
    .meta strong{display:block;color:#4a2f1f}
    .map{height:140px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fdeee0,#fff)}
    footer{margin-top:28px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid #f0e1d8;color:#8b6f5e;font-size:13px}
    .small-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
    .faq{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fff7f2);padding:16px;border-radius:12px}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .wrap{padding:20px;margin:18px}
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .brand h1{font-size:16px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="64" height="64" rx="12" fill="#f7e7db"/><path d="M16 40c6-8 18-8 24 0" stroke="#b06d3b" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:#9a7f6b">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="programs.html" class="active">Paths</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>Let's make a plan that fits your life</h2>
        <p class="lead">Reach out to start with a free clarity call — 20 minutes to map your next small step. No pressure, just a friendly space to explore routines, energy-balancing habits, and practical frameworks that actually stick.</p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div>
            <form id="contactForm" class="stack">
              <div style="display:flex;gap:10px">
                <div style="flex:1">
                  <label for="name">Your name</label>
                  <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="First & last" required />
                </div>
                <div style="width:36%">
                  <label for="phone">Phone</label>
                  <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="(optional)" />
                </div>
              </div>

              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required />

              <label for="interest">Which offering are you curious about?</label>
              <select id="interest" name="interest">
                <option>Choose a path</option>
                <option>Foundations: Daily Balance</option>
                <option>Momentum: 3-Month Habit Block</option>
                <option>Renewal: 6-Month Deep Work</option>
                <option>One-off clarity call</option>
              </select>

              <label for="message">Tell me what's on your mind</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="A few lines about your goals or a question."></textarea>

              <div class="submit-row">
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Request a free call</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn ghost" id="leadMagnetBtn">Get the Habit Starter Guide</button>
                <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;color:#8b6f5e">Or email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#8b6f5e;text-decoration:underline">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              </div>

              <p class="hint">By contacting us you consent to receive messages relevant to your inquiry. We respect your privacy and never sell contact lists.</p>
            </form>
          </div>

          <aside class="side-card">
            <div class="meta">
              <strong>Quick ways to connect</strong>
              <div style="font-size:14px">Call or text: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:#6b4a36;text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
              <div style="margin-top:8px">Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#6b4a36;text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div class="meta">
              <strong>Location</strong>
              <div style="font-size:14px">Serving individuals in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and virtual clients worldwide</div>
            </div>

            <div class="map" aria-hidden="true">
              <!-- Decorative local SVG pattern -->
              <svg viewBox="0 0 200 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%">
                <rect width="200" height="120" rx="10" fill="#fff7f2" />
                <g fill="#f2d9c9" opacity="0.85">
                  <circle cx="34" cy="34" r="28" />
                  <path d="M120 90c20-26 56-26 76 0v18H120z" />
                </g>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b6f5e">Prefer scheduling? <a href="book.html" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Reserve a time</a> for a clarity call.</div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
          <div class="panel" style="padding:18px">
            <img src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="{{COACH_NAME}}" style="width:100%;border-radius:12px;display:block;margin-bottom:12px" />
            <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#5a3f2c">Hey — I’m {{COACH_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h3>
            <p style="margin:0;color:#6a5544">I help busy people build routines that feel effortless. My approach centers on tiny, repeatable habits and a clear framework so progress becomes inevitable.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" style="padding:12px">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#5a3f2c">Need something quick?</h4>
            <div style="font-size:14px;color:#6b5543">If you have a short question, text or email and I’ll get back within 48 hours. For intake forms and program enrollment, use the form above.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px">
              <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <a class="btn ghost" href="programs.html">See paths</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="panel faq">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#5a3f2c">Common quick answers</h4>
            <div style="font-size:14px;color:#6b5543">
              <strong>How long until I notice a change?</strong>
              <div style="margin-bottom:10px">Most clients report tangible shifts within 3–6 weeks when they consistently apply the framework we outline.</div>
              <strong>Do you work virtually?</strong>
              <div>Yes — most sessions are remote via video. Local clients may request in-person sessions.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <section style="margin-top:26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;align-items:start">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:#5a3f2c">What happens after you submit the form?</h3>
        <ol style="padding-left:18px;color:#6a5544">
          <li>We’ll review your message and schedule your free clarity call.</li>
          <li>I send a short intake to prepare the session so we use time well.</li>
          <li>We build a 2–3 step starter plan you can try before committing.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="panel">
        <h4 style="margin-top:0;color:#5a3f2c">Quick resources</h4>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <a class="hint" href="#" id="downloadGuide" style="text-decoration:none;color:#8b6f5e">Free: Habit Starter Guide (PDF)</a>
          <a class="hint" href="programs.html" style="text-decoration:none;color:#8b6f5e">Compare program themes</a>
          <a class="hint" href="testimonials.html" style="text-decoration:none;color:#8b6f5e">Read client stories</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <div>© <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:#8b6f5e;text-decoration:none">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:#8b6f5e;text-decoration:none">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:#8b6f5e">Made with warmth. Built on routines and research-informed coaching methods.</div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      var leadBtn = document.getElementById('leadMagnetBtn');
      var download = document.getElementById('downloadGuide');

      form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
        e.preventDefault();
        var name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
        var email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
        if(!name || !email){
          alert('Please include your name and email so I can get back to you.');
          return;
        }
        // Simulated submission behavior for static site
        alert('Thanks ' + name + '! We received your request. Check ' + email + ' for next steps.');
        form.reset();
      });

      leadBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){
        // Fallback: open the lead magnet resource — static placeholder
        alert('Sending the Habit Starter Guide to your inbox. If you prefer, email {{EMAIL}} with subject "Guide".');
      });

      if(download){
        download.addEventListener('click', function(e){
          e.preventDefault();
          alert('Starting download: Habit Starter Guide — check your downloads folder.');
        });
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Website bundle (earthy_warm)

This chunk contains the contact page and a brief README for the wellness coach site.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — Contact page with warm, organic layout. Uses local SVGs: assets/img/avatar.svg and references general site pages.
- README.md — This file.

Placeholders to replace in templates:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Your business display name.
- {{TAGLINE}} — Short descriptive tagline.
- {{PHONE}} — Business phone (tel link).
- {{EMAIL}} — Contact email.
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — Primary CTA button label.
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — Primary CTA target URL.
- {{COACH_NAME}} — Coach's full name.
- {{CREDENTIALS}} — Short credential string (e.g., PCC, MAPP).
- {{CITY}} — City served.
- {{STATE}} — State served.

Design notes (earthy_warm):
- Warm tones, rounded cards, friendly spacing.
- Contact page includes a form, meta contact blocks, and a small coach profile panel.
- No external assets or CDNs are used; all imagery should be local.

Local assets expected elsewhere in full bundle (ensure these files exist in assets/img/):
- hero.svg
- avatar.svg
- pattern.svg

Behavior and integration:
- The contact form in contact.html simulates submission via JavaScript (static sites should replace this with a real backend or form provider).
- Lead magnet button and download links are placeholders that show an alert; wire these to an email automation or file host as needed.

Accessibility & privacy:
- Form fields are labeled. Keep privacy note visible and ensure compliance with privacy regulations for your region.

Deployment:
- This site is static HTML/CSS/JS and can be hosted on any static host (Netlify, GitHub Pages, Vercel, etc.).
- Replace placeholders before publishing.

If you need alternate layouts, additional pages, or integration snippets for form handling or newsletter signup, ask for the next chunk and indicate which provider (e.g., Formspree, Netlify Forms, HubSpot) you prefer."}
BUNDLE_END
